@title Loan portfolio quality, Q2 and Q3 2026
@subtitle For the board meeting on 2026-10-29
@author Anselm Wachira, Chief Risk Officer

## Portfolio at a glance
kpi Total loans | $1,639M | four loan types | neutral
kpi Delinquent 30+ days | 1.4% | up from 1.3% in Q2 | bad
kpi Charge-offs | $3.9M | Q3, up from $3.1M in Q2 | bad
kpi Allowance | $21.3M | 1.3% of loans | neutral

Weighted across the portfolio, delinquency rose from 1.3% in Q2 to 1.4% in Q3.

## Delinquency by loan type
data loans = loan type,balance,Q2,Q3; Auto,412,1.9,2.2; Mortgage,988,0.6,0.6; Personal,143,3.4,4.1; Revolving credit,96,2.8,3.0

chart bar loans y=Q2,Q3 unit=% labels title="Share of loans 30+ days delinquent, Q2 beside Q3"

