## What changed
- Personal loans have the highest delinquency, at 4.1% in Q3, and the largest rise, up 0.7 points.
- Auto loans rose more slowly, up 0.3 points. They matter more in dollars, at $412M.
- Mortgages, 60.3% of balances, were flat at 0.6%.
- Charge-offs rose to $3.9M in Q3 from $3.1M in Q2.

## Actions
step Tighten personal loan underwriting for credit scores below 640 | by 2026-11-15

- Add early outreach for auto loans at 15 days past due.
- Review reserve adequacy at the January meeting.
